  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Now, after some strange disconnects from VRChat server, i found out the login system is not very user friendly.\n\nThe disconnect cause should NOT forget my login / password. Because: why CAN it remember my login after normal log out? And it still remember too login after forced shutdown program.\n\nONLY disconnect, it forget for no reason my login. Just WHY?\n\nNot sure it's bug, but its frustrating to type again and again my login and password. Also if i am streaming, my login and password might visible through the stream. That is not good.\nThat is why it MUST stay remember my login/password, WHATEVER the reason it might me, disconnect or forced close program.\nThen i don't need enter login/password again, and that is much safer if my stream is still running. If you forgot to pause stream first, you have a problem.\n\nIf i want another login, i should choose another login inside the menu window. Then i can type again login/pass or go to Steam login. That is okay.\n\nThis is important feature. Please make it possible.\n\n(Just asking why i have disconnect, even my internet is fine - i can still login - is this not related to known bug / cause where other might hack my login and cause my knock out?)",
